{
  "info": {
    "name": "University Record Service",
    "description": "University Record through the Gateway: base_url is {{gateway}}/api/v1/university-record. A player's request names the player in X-Player-Id, which the collection pre-request script turns into a signed Bearer JWT; a service's request carries X-Service-Token. Events are pushed to POST /api/v1/events, so the collection demonstrates the full ingest -> search -> Moderation-view loop without any producer running. Run the 'scenario' folder top to bottom.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
